      <h1>How Linear designs its UI</h1>
      <p>Linear renders its sidebar on a 4px spacing scale. Every measurement
      is a multiple of four, which removes a whole class of alignment bugs
      from the design system.</p>
      <p>Notion, by contrast, leans on generous whitespace rather than a
      strict grid.</p>
